---
import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import WidgetWrapper from '~/components/ui/WidgetWrapper.astro';
import Headline from '~/components/ui/Headline.astro';
import Hero2 from '~/components/widgets/Hero2.astro';
import FAQs from '~/components/widgets/FAQs.astro';
import Timeline from '~/components/ui/Timeline.astro';
import simplePattern from '~/assets/images/patterns/simple.svg';

const metadata = {
  title: 'Asphalt Shingle Roofing Hawaii & Oahu | R&C Roofing',
  description:
    'Explore asphalt shingle roofing for Oahu homes. Compare shingle options, Hawaii-specific considerations, replacement factors, and installation with R&C Roofing Contractors.',
  ignoreTitleTemplate: true,
};
---

<Layout metadata={metadata}>

  <!-- P-01 · Hero -->
  <Hero2
    actions={[{ variant: 'primary', text: 'Discuss an Asphalt Shingle Roof', href: '/contact' }]}
    image={{
      src: 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558618666-fcd25c85cd64?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80',
      alt: 'Asphalt shingle roofing on an Oahu home',
    }}
  >
    <Fragment slot="title">
      Asphalt Shingle Roofing<br />on Oahu
    </Fragment>
    <Fragment slot="subtitle">
      <span class="block text-[20px] md:text-[24px] font-medium font-heading text-heading mb-6 leading-[130%] tracking-tight">
        A Familiar Roofing Option With Plenty of Choices
      </span>
      Asphalt shingles are a common option for sloped residential roofs, but not every shingle or roofing system is the same. Product type, roof design, property exposure, installation details, and the condition of the existing roof can all affect the project.
      <br /><br />
      R&amp;C Roofing Contractors installs asphalt shingle roofing for properties within its Oahu service area. Whether you are replacing an existing shingle roof or considering shingles for a new roofing project, we can help you evaluate the property and compare the available options.
      <br /><br />
    R&amp;C operates under Hawaii contractor license C-33642.
  </Fragment>
  <Fragment slot="bg">
    <div class="absolute inset-0" style="-webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, black 0%, transparent 100%); mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, black 0%, transparent 100%);">
      <div
        class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[6%]"
        style={`background-color: var(--aw-color-accent); -webkit-mask-image: url('${simplePattern.src}'); mask-image: url('${simplePattern.src}'); -webkit-mask-size: cover; mask-size: cover; -webkit-mask-mode: luminance; mask-mode: luminance;`}
        aria-hidden="true"
      ></div>
    </div>
  </Fragment>
</Hero2>

  <!-- Is Asphalt Shingle Roofing Right for Your Home? · grey bg -->
  <WidgetWrapper containerClass="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto">
    <Headline title="Is Asphalt Shingle Roofing Right for Your Home?" classes={{ container: 'mb-4 md:mb-6' }} />
    <p class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-10 md:mb-14 text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-medium leading-[160%] text-muted">
      Asphalt shingles may be worth considering when you want a traditional residential roofing appearance with multiple product and style choices. The right decision depends on the individual property, not simply which material is most popular.
    </p>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6 md:gap-8">
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-accent/60 bg-[#222] p-6 md:p-8">
        <h3 class="text-[22px] md:text-[26px] font-medium font-heading leading-[130%] mb-6 text-white">
          Asphalt Shingles May Be Worth Considering If
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-4">
          {[
            'You want a familiar roofing style for a sloped home.',
            'You want access to a range of colors and profiles.',
            'You are comparing different product options within a roofing budget.',
            'You are replacing an existing asphalt shingle roof and want to evaluate similar or upgraded options.',
          ].map((item) => (
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="mt-0.5 text-accent font-bold shrink-0 text-[18px] leading-[160%]">›</span>
              <span class="text-[15px] md:text-[16px] font-medium leading-[160%] text-white/60">{item}</span>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-accent/60 bg-[#222] p-6 md:p-8">
        <h3 class="text-[22px] md:text-[26px] font-medium font-heading leading-[130%] mb-6 text-white">
          Look Closely at Other Options If
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-4">
          {[
            'You prefer the appearance of metal, tile, or another roofing system.',
            'The roof design is not appropriate for the shingle system being considered.',
            'Property conditions make another roofing material a better fit.',
            'Your priorities point toward a different roofing system or material.',
          ].map((item) => (
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="mt-0.5 text-accent font-bold shrink-0 text-[18px] leading-[160%]">›</span>
              <span class="text-[15px] md:text-[16px] font-medium leading-[160%] text-white/60">{item}</span>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-8 text-center">
      <a href="/services/roofing-materials" class="btn btn-secondary">Compare Roofing Materials</a>
    </div>
    <Fragment slot="bg">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#FAFAFA] dark:bg-slate-900/30"></div>
    </Fragment>
  </WidgetWrapper>

  <!-- What Are Asphalt Shingles? · black bg -->
  <WidgetWrapper containerClass="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto" isDark={true}>
    <h2 class="text-[30px] md:text-[40px] font-normal leading-[120%] tracking-tighter font-heading text-white mb-8 md:mb-10">
      What Are Asphalt Shingles?
    </h2>
    <div class="text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-medium leading-[160%] text-white/70 space-y-5">
      <p>
        Modern asphalt shingles are typically made with a fiberglass mat coated with asphalt and surfaced with mineral granules. The shingles work as part of a larger roofing assembly that can also include underlayment, starter materials, flashing, and hip and ridge components.
      </p>
      <p>
        That distinction matters. When you choose asphalt shingles, you are not choosing only the visible material. The performance of the roof also depends on the complete roofing system and how its components work together.
      </p>
    </div>
    <Fragment slot="bg">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black"></div>
      <div class="absolute inset-0" style="-webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, black 0%, transparent 100%); mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, black 0%, transparent 100%);">
        <div
          class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[8%]"
          style={`background-color: var(--aw-color-accent); -webkit-mask-image: url('${simplePattern.src}'); mask-image: url('${simplePattern.src}'); -webkit-mask-size: cover; mask-size: cover; -webkit-mask-mode: luminance; mask-mode: luminance;`}
          aria-hidden="true"
        ></div>
      </div>
    </Fragment>
  </WidgetWrapper>

  <!-- Understanding Asphalt Shingle Options · white bg -->
  <WidgetWrapper containerClass="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto">
    <Headline title="Understanding Asphalt Shingle Options" classes={{ container: 'mb-4 md:mb-6' }} />
    <p class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-10 md:mb-14 text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-medium leading-[160%] text-muted">
      There are different types and styles of asphalt shingles. The right type depends on the property, roof design, and appearance preferences.
    </p>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6 md:gap-8">
      {[
        {
          title: 'Architectural or Laminated Shingles',
          description:
            'Laminated shingles contain more than one layer of tabs, creating additional thickness and a more dimensional appearance. They are also commonly called architectural or dimensional shingles.',
        },
        {
          title: 'Three-Tab Shingles',
          description:
            'Three-tab shingles use a single-layer configuration with cutouts that create three visible tabs. They offer a simpler, flatter appearance compared to architectural shingles.',
        },
        {
          title: 'Specialty and Designer Shingles',
          description:
            'Manufacturers also offer shingles in different shapes, profiles, colors, and configurations designed to create different architectural appearances.',
        },
      ].map(({ title, description }) => (
        <div class="intersect-once intersect-quarter motion-safe:md:opacity-0 motion-safe:md:intersect:animate-fade">
          <h3 class="text-[22px] md:text-[26px] font-medium font-heading leading-[130%] mb-3">{title}</h3>
          <p class="text-[14px] md:text-[15px] font-medium leading-[160%] text-muted">{description}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
    <Fragment slot="bg">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-white dark:bg-transparent"></div>
    </Fragment>
  </WidgetWrapper>

  <!-- Asphalt Shingles and Oahu Conditions · grey bg -->
  <WidgetWrapper containerClass="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto">
    <Headline title="Asphalt Shingles and Oahu Conditions" classes={{ container: 'mb-4 md:mb-6' }} />
    <p class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-10 md:mb-14 text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-medium leading-[160%] text-muted">
      The property's location should be part of the roofing discussion. Oahu's conditions vary and can influence the shingle product and system that should be considered.
    </p>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 md:gap-8">
      {[
        {
          title: 'Sun and Heat',
          description:
            'Asphalt shingles are continuously exposed to sun and weather. The specific product, roof configuration, ventilation where applicable, and overall roofing system should all be considered rather than assuming every shingle will perform identically.',
        },
        {
          title: 'Wind Exposure',
          description:
            'Wind performance depends on more than the word "shingle." IBHS research has found that the strength of the seal between self-sealing asphalt shingles is an important factor in high-wind performance. Age and weathering can also affect shingle performance over time.',
        },
        {
          title: 'Rain and Moisture',
          description:
            'The shingles are only one part of how the roof manages water. Flashing, underlayment, penetrations, valleys, roof edges, and other components can be just as important when evaluating a roofing system.',
        },
        {
          title: 'Algae Discoloration',
          description:
            'Dark streaks can sometimes develop on asphalt roofing because of algae. ARMA notes that algae discoloration affects appearance but has not been scientifically shown to damage shingles. Some manufacturers offer algae-resistant products.',
        },
      ].map(({ title, description }) => (
        <div class="intersect-once intersect-quarter motion-safe:md:opacity-0 motion-safe:md:intersect:animate-fade">
          <h3 class="text-[22px] md:text-[26px] font-medium font-heading leading-[130%] mb-3">{title}</h3>
          <p class="text-[14px] md:text-[15px] font-medium leading-[160%] text-muted">{description}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
    <Fragment slot="bg">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#FAFAFA] dark:bg-slate-900/30"></div>
    </Fragment>
  </WidgetWrapper>

  <!-- Advantages and Tradeoffs · black bg -->
  <WidgetWrapper containerClass="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto" isDark={true}>
    <Headline title="Advantages and Tradeoffs of Asphalt Shingle Roofing" classes={{ container: 'mb-4 md:mb-6', title: 'text-[30px] md:text-[40px] font-normal leading-[120%] text-white' }} />
    <p class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-10 md:mb-14 text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-medium leading-[160%] text-white/70">
      No roofing material is perfect for every property. R&amp;C can help you evaluate the shingle system in the context of the home rather than choosing from appearance alone.
    </p>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6 md:gap-8">
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-accent/60 bg-[#222] p-6 md:p-8">
        <h3 class="text-[22px] md:text-[26px] font-medium font-heading leading-[130%] mb-6 text-white">Potential Advantages</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-4">
          {[
            'Wide range of colors, profiles, and styles',
            'Familiar appearance for many residential properties',
            'Multiple product levels may provide different options for a project',
            'Localized repairs may sometimes be possible when the surrounding roof remains serviceable',
            'Straightforward material to compare visually',
          ].map((item) => (
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="mt-0.5 text-accent font-bold shrink-0 text-[18px] leading-[160%]">›</span>
              <span class="text-[15px] md:text-[16px] font-medium leading-[160%] text-white/60">{item}</span>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-accent/60 bg-[#222] p-6 md:p-8">
        <h3 class="text-[22px] md:text-[26px] font-medium font-heading leading-[130%] mb-6 text-white">Considerations</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-4">
          {[
            'Product quality and performance characteristics vary',
            'Exposure and weathering affect the roofing system over time',
            'Not every shingle is suitable for every roof design or exposure condition',
            'Matching older shingles can be difficult because products may be discontinued or weathered',
            'The complete roofing assembly matters, not just the visible shingle',
          ].map((item) => (
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="mt-0.5 text-accent font-bold shrink-0 text-[18px] leading-[160%]">›</span>
              <span class="text-[15px] md:text-[16px] font-medium leading-[160%] text-white/60">{item}</span>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <Fragment slot="bg">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black"></div>
      <div class="absolute inset-0" style="-webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, black 0%, transparent 100%); mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, black 0%, transparent 100%);">
        <div
          class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[8%]"
          style={`background-color: var(--aw-color-accent); -webkit-mask-image: url('${simplePattern.src}'); mask-image: url('${simplePattern.src}'); -webkit-mask-size: cover; mask-size: cover; -webkit-mask-mode: luminance; mask-mode: luminance;`}
          aria-hidden="true"
        ></div>
      </div>
    </Fragment>
  </WidgetWrapper>

  <!-- How Long Does an Asphalt Shingle Roof Last? · white bg -->
  <WidgetWrapper containerClass="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto">
    <h2 class="text-[30px] md:text-[40px] font-normal leading-[120%] tracking-tighter font-heading text-heading mb-8 md:mb-10">
      How Long Does an Asphalt Shingle Roof Last?
    </h2>
    <div class="text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-medium leading-[160%] text-muted space-y-5 mb-8">
      <p>We would not publish one lifespan number for every asphalt shingle roof. Actual service life can vary based on a range of factors, and manufacturer warranty periods are not the same thing as the expected service life of a roof.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 md:gap-4">
      {[
        'Shingle product',
        'Roof design and slope',
        'Installation',
        'Sun and weather exposure',
        'Wind exposure',
        'Maintenance',
        'Ventilation where applicable',
        'Flashing and other roofing components',
        'Previous repairs or damage',
      ].map((item) => (
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="mt-0.5 text-primary font-bold shrink-0 text-[18px] leading-[160%]">›</span>
          <span class="text-[15px] md:text-[16px] font-medium leading-[160%] text-muted">{item}</span>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
    <Fragment slot="bg">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-white dark:bg-transparent"></div>
    </Fragment>
  </WidgetWrapper>

  <!-- What Does Asphalt Shingle Roofing Cost on Oahu? · grey bg -->
  <WidgetWrapper containerClass="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto">
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between gap-4 mb-8 md:mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-[30px] md:text-[40px] font-normal leading-[120%] tracking-tighter font-heading text-heading">
        What Does Asphalt Shingle Roofing Cost on Oahu?
      </h2>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary shrink-0">Request an Estimate</a>
    </div>
    <p class="text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-medium leading-[160%] text-muted mb-8 md:mb-10">
      There is no single price that applies to every shingle roof. R&amp;C can provide project-specific pricing after evaluating the roof and determining the proposed scope. The total project cost can depend on several factors.
    </p>
    <div class="divide-y divide-gray-200 dark:divide-gray-700 border-t border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">
      {[
        {
          title: 'Shingle Product',
          description: 'Different product lines and styles have different material costs.',
        },
        {
          title: 'Roof Size',
          description: 'The amount of roofing material and labor increases with the roofing area.',
        },
        {
          title: 'Roof Design',
          description: 'Valleys, hips, penetrations, transitions, steep sections, and other details can affect installation.',
        },
        {
          title: 'Existing Roof Condition',
          description: 'Replacement projects may require additional work depending on the condition of the existing roof and what is found during construction.',
        },
        {
          title: 'Underlying Components',
          description: 'Decking, underlayment, flashing, and other components may affect the final roofing scope.',
        },
        {
          title: 'Access',
          description: 'Property access, roof height, and construction logistics can also influence project cost.',
        },
      ].map(({ title, description }) => (
        <div class="py-6 md:py-8 flex flex-col intersect-once intersect-quarter motion-safe:md:opacity-0 motion-safe:md:intersect:animate-fade">
          <h3 class="text-[22px] md:text-[26px] font-medium font-heading leading-[130%] mb-2">{title}</h3>
          <p class="text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-medium leading-[160%] text-muted">{description}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
    <Fragment slot="bg">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#FAFAFA] dark:bg-slate-900/30"></div>
    </Fragment>
  </WidgetWrapper>

  <!-- Replacing an Existing Shingle Roof? · black bg -->
  <WidgetWrapper containerClass="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto" isDark={true}>
    <h2 class="text-[30px] md:text-[40px] font-normal leading-[120%] tracking-tighter font-heading text-white mb-8 md:mb-10">
      Replacing an Existing Shingle Roof?
    </h2>
    <div class="text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-medium leading-[160%] text-white/70 space-y-5 mb-8">
      <p>An existing asphalt shingle roof does not automatically mean the new roof has to use exactly the same type of shingle. A replacement project gives you an opportunity to look at several things.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 md:gap-4 mb-8">
      {[
        'Current shingle options',
        'Colors and profiles',
        'Existing roof condition',
        'Areas that have required previous repair',
        'Flashing and roof details',
        'Other roofing materials you may want to compare',
      ].map((item) => (
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="mt-0.5 text-accent font-bold shrink-0 text-[18px] leading-[160%]">›</span>
          <span class="text-[15px] md:text-[16px] font-medium leading-[160%] text-white/60">{item}</span>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
    <div class="text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-medium leading-[160%] text-white/70 mb-8">
      <p>R&amp;C can inspect the existing roof and help you decide whether another asphalt shingle system or a different roofing material should be considered.</p>
    </div>
    <a href="/services/roof-replacement-and-new-installation" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 rounded-md border-2 border-accent text-white font-semibold text-[15px] leading-snug hover:bg-accent hover:text-black transition-colors duration-200">Explore Roof Replacement</a>
    <Fragment slot="bg">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black"></div>
      <div class="absolute inset-0" style="-webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, black 0%, transparent 100%); mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, black 0%, transparent 100%);">
        <div
          class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[8%]"
          style={`background-color: var(--aw-color-accent); -webkit-mask-image: url('${simplePattern.src}'); mask-image: url('${simplePattern.src}'); -webkit-mask-size: cover; mask-size: cover; -webkit-mask-mode: luminance; mask-mode: luminance;`}
          aria-hidden="true"
        ></div>
      </div>
    </Fragment>
  </WidgetWrapper>

  <!-- Can an Asphalt Shingle Roof Be Repaired? · white bg -->
  <WidgetWrapper containerClass="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto">
    <h2 class="text-[30px] md:text-[40px] font-normal leading-[120%] tracking-tighter font-heading text-heading mb-8 md:mb-10">
      Can an Asphalt Shingle Roof Be Repaired?
    </h2>
    <div class="text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-medium leading-[160%] text-muted space-y-5 mb-8">
      <p>Sometimes. Missing, displaced, or damaged shingles may be repairable when the problem is localized and the surrounding roofing system remains serviceable.</p>
      <p>The existing product also matters. An exact color or profile match may not always be available, especially when older shingles have weathered or the original product is no longer manufactured.</p>
      <p>If problems are appearing throughout the roof, replacement may need to be considered instead of continuing with localized repairs.</p>
    </div>
    <a href="/services/roof-repair" class="btn-primary">Explore Roof Repair</a>
    <Fragment slot="bg">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-white dark:bg-transparent"></div>
    </Fragment>
  </WidgetWrapper>

  <!-- How R&C Approaches an Asphalt Shingle Roofing Project · grey bg -->
  <WidgetWrapper containerClass="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto">
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between gap-4 mb-8 md:mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-[30px] md:text-[40px] font-normal leading-[120%] tracking-tighter font-heading text-heading">
        How R&amp;C Approaches an Asphalt Shingle Roofing Project
      </h2>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary shrink-0">Plan Your Asphalt Shingle Roof</a>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-10 md:gap-16">
      <div class="md:basis-1/2 flex flex-col gap-6">
        <div class="text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-medium leading-[160%] text-muted dark:text-slate-400">
          <p>Every asphalt shingle roofing project begins with the property. R&amp;C evaluates the existing conditions, reviews the available options, and develops a roofing scope based on what the project actually requires — not a generic estimate.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="md:basis-1/2">
        <Timeline
          items={[
            {
              title: 'Evaluate the Roof',
              description:
                'For replacement work, we start with the condition of the existing roofing system and the goals for the project.',
              icon: 'tabler:search',
            },
            {
              title: 'Review Shingle Options',
              description:
                'Available asphalt shingle products can be compared based on the property, appearance preferences, and project requirements.',
              icon: 'tabler:template',
            },
            {
              title: 'Develop the Roofing Scope',
              description:
                'R&C defines the proposed roofing work based on the existing conditions and selected roofing system.',
              icon: 'tabler:file-description',
            },
            {
              title: 'Prepare the Property for Roofing Work',
              description:
                'The existing system is addressed according to the agreed project scope. Conditions that become visible during construction may affect the work needed before installation continues.',
              icon: 'tabler:tool',
            },
            {
              title: 'Install the Roofing System',
              description:
                'R&C installs the agreed asphalt shingle system and associated roofing components according to the project specifications and applicable requirements.',
              icon: 'tabler:home-check',
            },
            {
              title: 'Complete the Project',
              description: 'The project moves through the applicable finishing and cleanup steps.',
              icon: 'tabler:check',
            },
          ]}
        />
      </div>
    </div>
    <Fragment slot="bg">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#FAFAFA] dark:bg-slate-900/30"></div>
    </Fragment>
  </WidgetWrapper>

  <!-- Asphalt Shingles for Oahu Homes · black bg -->
  <WidgetWrapper containerClass="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto" isDark={true}>
    <h2 class="text-[30px] md:text-[40px] font-normal leading-[120%] tracking-tighter font-heading text-white mb-8 md:mb-10">
      Asphalt Shingles for Oahu Homes
    </h2>
    <div class="text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-medium leading-[160%] text-white/70 space-y-5 mb-8">
      <p>Asphalt shingles are primarily associated with residential sloped roofing. For homeowners, one advantage of considering shingles is the range of available appearances. The roof can be selected to work with the architectural style and exterior colors of the home.</p>
      <p>R&amp;C can also help you compare asphalt shingles with metal, stone-coated steel, and tile before making the final material decision.</p>
    </div>
    <a href="/services/residential-roofing" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 rounded-md border-2 border-accent text-white font-semibold text-[15px] leading-snug hover:bg-accent hover:text-black transition-colors duration-200">Explore Residential Roofing</a>
    <Fragment slot="bg">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black"></div>
